      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170366\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170366\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The thickness of slabs with ribbed or undulating soffits (see <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-170365', hash: '#JD_BCFigure722.2.2.1.3' }}\">Figure 722.2.2.1.3<\/Link>) shall be determined by one of the following expressions, whichever is applicable:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170367\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170367\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;For s <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#8805;<\/span> 4t, the thickness to be used shall be t <\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170368\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170368\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;For s <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#8804;<\/span> 2t, the thickness to be used shall be t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">e<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170369\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170369\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;For 4t &gt; s &gt; 2t, the thickness to be used shall be<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170370\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170370\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;",
      "id" : "15222-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "The thickness of slabs with ribbed or undulating soffits (see Figure 722.2.2.1.3 ) shall be determined by one of the following expressions, whichever is applicable:\n\n For s &#8805; 4t, the thickness to be used shall be t \n\n For s &#8804; 2t, the thickness to be used shall be t\n\n e \n\n For 4t > s > 2t, the thickness to be used shall be"
